# Amity Square in Hearthome City (the original's D_KOUEN role): a carefree B-flat stroll in six-eight through the
# park, the clarinet skipping along with a piccolo chirping at its heels like a Pokémon beside its trainer, the
# marimba and the tuba keeping the bounce. Original composition for this game.
